customer identity; (2) **Key Discoveries**: your top 3-5 findings, stated the way a decision-maker wants to hear them, not as code output; (3) **Future Growth Recommendations**: at least 3 concrete, data-backed recommendations for what Nivaas Home should do before next Diwali. This is the deliverable a hiring manager would actually read, so treat it that way."}]}, {"key": "stretch", "title": "Stretch ideas (optional)", "tasks": [{"id": "X-S2", "text": "Test the pull-forward theory: did November and December volume dip because Diwali buyers had already bought? Compare against the other non-sale months and be honest about what the data can and cannot prove."}, {"id": "X-S1", "text": "Simulate a 30% discount cap on Air Fryers and Induction Cooktops during the Diwali peak. State your assumption about how much volume you would lose, then estimate the contribution you would have made instead."}, {"id": "X-S3", "text": "Compare couriers and warehouses on delivery time and return rate. Does a slower courier cause more returns, or is the difference explained by marketplace and category mix?"}]}]}$pack$::jsonb
