rs as proper JOIN queries."}, {"id": "X2", "text": "**Prove the COD gap is real.** COD orders return, cancel and RTO far more often than prepaid ones. Run a statistical test (chi-square or two-proportion z-test) and decide whether the gap survives once you control for marketplace and category mix. Show your work."}]}$pack$::jsonb
